Subject: [PATCH 11/27] perf(scip): release unused receipt index payloads

Validate every complete SCIP field with the official protobuf decoder while retaining only metadata and document paths needed by source receipts. Preserve nested malformed-data refusal, duplicate metadata merging and legacy partial-metadata behavior.

Verified: public retention regression RED 16824176 bytes, GREEN 47344 bytes; official whole-protobuf parity fixtures, complete internal/scip normal and race tests pass. Independent source review found no blocking findings. Full canonical gate and actual cold qualification remain pending.
